WEBVTT

00:04:58.294 --> 00:05:00.629
personally accountable
for all sorts of things.

00:05:01.672 --> 00:05:03.215
But I can tell you

00:05:03.215 --> 00:05:05.676
we learned an immense amount
from those experiences.

00:05:05.676 --> 00:05:07.428
I know I personally did.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.513
There were a lot of lessons.

00:05:09.555 --> 00:05:11.974
And one of those lessons

00:05:11.974 --> 00:05:16.187
was how important
stability and predictability

00:05:16.228 --> 00:05:17.813
were to publishers.

00:05:19.023 --> 00:05:23.319
No publisher can build a business
on a platform that's too volatile,

00:05:23.319 --> 00:05:27.323
and no business should be entirely reliant
on any one platform.